# Startup Optimization

## Splash Screen Pattern

```java
public class MainApp extends Application {
    @Override
    public void start(Stage stage) {
        // Show splash immediately
        SplashScreen splash = new SplashScreen();
        splash.show();

        // Initialize DB in background
        Thread.startVirtualThread(() -> {
            DatabaseInitializer db = new DatabaseInitializer();
            Platform.runLater(() -> {
                InventoryService service = new InventoryService(
                    new EbeanProductRepository(db.getDatabase())
                );
                MainView view = new MainView(service);
                stage.setScene(new Scene(view.getRoot(), 900, 600));
                splash.hide();
                stage.show();
            });
        });
    }
}
```

## CDS Archive

```bash
# Build archive
java -Xshare:dump -XX:SharedArchiveFile=app.jsa -cp target/app.jar

# Use archive
java -Xshare:on -XX:SharedArchiveFile=app.jsa -jar target/app.jar
```